# mod-custom-spells: the Priest custom class spells (the /spells picker) on a
# bot. Every check states the CONCEPT's behaviour (share-public
# custom-spells/08-rework-20261008.md), so a FAIL marks a defect.
# Test ground: map 13, the FL dummy arena - eight AoE Training Dummies
# (920018) on a 4-yd circle around (-270, 150). Slot 4 belongs to the cs_*
# scenarios; the cleanup unlearns every custom spell again.
# Spells: Power Word: Shield 48066 (30 s; Weakened Soul 6788, 15 s), Flash
# Heal 48071, Shadow Word: Pain 48125, Holy Fire 48135, Holy Nova 48078 (a
# triggered cast keeps the dummies in combat: a dummy leaves combat 5 s after
# its last direct hit), Emberseer Bonus Damage 16534 (2000 physical to the
# caster, fixed: a real hit that the shield absorbs - .damage bypasses absorbs
# and procs). 900900, 900933 and 900966 as revised on 2026-10-08
# (custom-spells/09; their new numbers: cs_rev_priest).
name    Custom spells - Priest
timeout 300s

bot pr priest slot=4

place 13 -279 150 -423.2 0
require pr alive
pick d1 creature:920018 near pr
require d1 exists
do gm target pr
as gm .unlearn 900900
as gm .unlearn 900901
as gm .unlearn 900902
as gm .unlearn 900933
as gm .unlearn 900966
as gm .unlearn 900967
as gm .unlearn 901101
as gm .unlearn 901102
as gm .unlearn 901103
as gm .unlearn 901104
as gm .unaura 48066
as gm .unaura 6788
do pr learn 48066
do pr learn 48071
do pr learn 48125
do pr goto -263 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
pick de creature:920018 near pr
do pr goto -270 157 -423.2
wait 500ms
pick dn creature:920018 near pr
do pr goto -270 143 -423.2
wait 500ms
pick ds creature:920018 near pr
do pr goto -264 155 -423.2
wait 500ms
pick dne creature:920018 near pr
do pr goto -279 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do pr approach d1
wait 500ms

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Shadow
log Shadow - 900966 CONCEPT DoT ticks (20 %, 2 s ICD) erupt in Shadow damage AROUND THE DOT TARGET (helper 900968); 900967 DoT ticks (15 %, 3 s ICD) copy the DoT to up to 2 nearby enemies - Shadow Word: Pain on 5 dummies from 23 yd away, statistical (about 30 ticks); a copy is a cast of its own, so the copies are counted as casts (5 + at least 2) - a missed copy damages nobody (bot run 485: 7 casts, 1 miss, 6 damaged)
do pr learn 900966
do pr learn 900967
do pr goto -293 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do pr reset
spelllog start
do pr cast 48125 on d1
wait 1600ms
do pr cast 48125 on dn
wait 1600ms
do pr cast 48125 on ds
wait 1600ms
do pr cast 48125 on de
wait 1600ms
do pr cast 48125 on dne
wait 19s
spelllog stop
expect pr spell 900968 casts >= 1
expect pr spell 900968 targets >= 5
expect pr spell 48125 casts >= 7
as gm .unlearn 900966
as gm .unlearn 900967

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Discipline
log Discipline - 900901 CONCEPT shields +50 %: the absorb of Power Word: Shield is built with the all-effects modifier
do pr goto -270 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do pr learn 900901
expect pr spellmod 48066 alleffects 100 == 150
as gm .unlearn 900901

log Discipline - 900900 a BROKEN Power Word: Shield explodes (900903) on every enemy within 10 yd of the shielded unit (the priest in the ring; 2 x 16534 break it) - also the absorb baseline without 900901
do pr learn 900900
do pr reset
expect pr maxhealth > 0
do pr cast 48066 on pr
wait 300ms
spelllog start
do pr cast 16534 on pr
do pr cast 16534 on pr
wait 500ms
spelllog stop
expect pr noaura 48066
expect pr spell 900903 targets >= 7
expect pr health > 0

log Discipline - 900901 CONCEPT shields +50 %: the same shield and hits leave the priest 50 % of the baseline absorb healthier (calibration 2026-10-08: 7450 max health, 2 x 1987 damage, base absorb about 2250: without the bonus about 5740 left, with it about 6860)
do pr learn 900901
wait 1600ms
do pr reset
as gm .unaura 6788
do pr cast 48066 on pr
wait 300ms
do pr cast 16534 on pr
do pr cast 16534 on pr
wait 500ms
expect pr health >= 6300

log Discipline - 900902 CONCEPT Weakened Soul (6788) lasts only 5 s: on another unit (the director) and on the priest
do pr learn 900902
wait 1600ms
do pr reset
do gm target gm
as gm .unaura 6788
as gm .unaura 48066
do pr cast 48066 on gm
wait 300ms
expect gm aura 6788
expect gm auraduration 6788 <= 5000
as gm .unaura 48066
as gm .unaura 6788
do gm target pr
as gm .unaura 6788
as gm .unaura 48066
wait 1600ms
do pr reset
do pr cast 48066 on pr
wait 300ms
expect pr aura 6788
expect pr auraduration 6788 <= 5000
as gm .unlearn 900902

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Holy (+ a fading shield)
log Holy - 900933 (revised 2026-10-08) direct heals: 50 % (no cooldown) for Holy Fire (900934, no facing rule) on ONE random enemy in combat within 30 yd of the healed unit - 18 Flash Heals on the priest in the ring's middle, a Holy Nova (triggered) before every second heal keeps the dummies in combat; statistical (9 expected); meanwhile (900900) a shield that FADES after 30 s explodes too
do pr learn 900933
wait 1600ms
do pr reset
as gm .unaura 6788
as gm .unaura 48066
do pr cast 48066 on pr
wait 1600ms
spelllog start
do pr cast 48078 triggered
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr cast 48078 triggered
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr cast 48078 triggered
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr reset
do pr cast 48078 triggered
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr cast 48078 triggered
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr cast 48078 triggered
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr reset
do pr cast 48078 triggered
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr cast 48078 triggered
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr cast 48078 triggered
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
wait 1s
spelllog stop
expect pr spell 48071 casts >= 15
expect pr spell 900934 casts >= 3
expect pr spell 900934 maxtargets == 1
expect pr noaura 48066
expect pr spell 900903 targets >= 7

cleanup
do pr stop
do gm target gm
as gm .unaura 6788
as gm .unaura 48066
do gm target pr
as gm .unlearn 900900
as gm .unlearn 900901
as gm .unlearn 900902
as gm .unlearn 900933
as gm .unlearn 900966
as gm .unlearn 900967
as gm .unlearn 901101
as gm .unlearn 901102
as gm .unlearn 901103
as gm .unlearn 901104
as gm .unaura 48066
as gm .unaura 6788
